- Mission 300: 300 million people (electricity in Sub-Saharan Africa)
- AgriConnect: 300 million farmers up the value chain
- Capital Support: 80 million women & women-led businesses
- Water Forward: 1 billion+ people; 400 million WBG commitment

### 6. KEY RESEARCH THEMES (compact footer section)
Five theme columns:
- Fiscal Policy: Fiscal rules (Jan. 2026); small states (June 2024)
- Trade & Supply Chains: High trade costs (June 2021); COVID-19 & GVCs (June 2020)
- Commodity Markets: Price cycles (Jan. 2022); Russia-Ukraine energy (June 2022)
- Financial Spillovers: Rising U.S. rates (June 2023); debt buildup (Jan. 2020)
- Pandemic Economics: COVID-19 & inequality (Jan. 2022); regional impacts (June 2020)

## Key Design Priorities
- Metrics are the visual centerpiece — large bold numerals with concise labels
- Emphasize tension between resilience and risk
- Risks section deserves strong visual weight
- Mood: Authoritative, calm, evidence-based
- Subtle dividers, no heavy borders
- World Bank report aesthetic

